<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Vanstar as accumulate.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Vanstar as accumulate.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Deutsche Morgan Grenfell said analyst Steven Fortuna initiated coverage of Vanstar Corp with an accumulate rating.</p>
<p>-- estimated earnings of $1.02 per share for 1997, and $1.36 for 1998, versus $0.52 in 1996.</p>
<p>-- set 12-18 month price target of $35-$38. Shares gained 1/8 to 27-3/4.</p>
</text>
